        "text": "=Hello,\n\nWe received your {{$('Normalize Request').first().json.requestType}} request on {{ $('Normalize Request').first().json.receivedAt.slice(0, 10) }} under {{$('Normalize Request').first().json.jurisdictionName}}.\nWe will respond by {{$('Normalize Request').first().json.deadline}}. If we need more time, we will tell you why before that date.\n\nTo confirm the request came from you, open this link within 7 days:\n{{$execution.resumeUrl}}\n\nIf you did not make this request, ignore this email.\n\nReference: {{$('Normalize Request').first().json.requestId}}",
